        "source_snippet": "LARRY NEUMEISTER Updated Sep 13, 2024 FILE - FTX founder Sam Bankman-Fried leaves federal court in Manhattan, Feb. 16, 2023. (AP Photo/John Minchillo, File) (ASSOCIATED PRESS) NEW YORK (AP) — Lawyers for [Sam Bankman-Fried](https://apnews.com/hub/sam-bankman-fried) claim in an appeal filed Friday th…",
