    "id": "q_culture_20251231_019_09308fa6",
    "title": "By what date will Courtney Love's re-shot Sundance documentary be released?",
    "question_type": "timeframe",
    "options": [
      "2025-09-15"
    ],
    "background": "Courtney Love's documentary, which was a hit at Sundance, is being reshot. This question asks for the eventual release date of the new version.",
    "resolution_criteria": "The release date will be the first day the documentary is made available to the public, either through a theatrical release or on a major streaming platform.",
    "outcome": "2025-09-15",
    "explanation": "## Executive Summary\nThe re-shot Sundance documentary about Courtney Love was finally released on September 15, 2025. Following its initial Sundance premiere, significant creative differences led to necessary reshoots in early 2024. These reshoots delayed the project but ultimately paved the way for the finalized September 2025 release.\n\n## Timeline Of Key Events\n- **March 15, 2024:** It is announced that the documentary will undergo extensive reshoots following its Sundance premiere ([art_culture_20240315_002_44849d65]).\n- **August 10, 2025:** A firm release date of September 15, 2025, is officially set after the completion of post-production ([art_culture_20250810_003_9a8d8418]).\n- **September 15, 2025:** The finalized documentary is released to the public.\n\n## Causal Chain Analysis\nThe root cause of the delay was the initial reception and creative dissatisfaction following the Sundance screening, which caused the filmmakers to authorize reshoots ([art_culture_20240315_002_44849d65]). This extended production period led to a prolonged editing phase. The completion of this phase resulted in the studio formally setting the September 15, 2025 release date ([art_culture_20250810_003_9a8d8418]), which triggered the final release on that date.\n\n## Countervailing Factors\nSome early speculation suggested the documentary might be shelved entirely due to the cost of reshoots and creative clashes. However, the strong initial interest and dedicated production team pushed through these obstacles, ensuring the project's completion.\n\n## Event Candidate Inventory\n- E1\n    - title: Documentary reshoots announced\n    - date: 2024-03-15\n    - why it matters causally: Initiated the delay and extended production timeline.\n    - source article IDs: [art_culture_20240315_002_44849d65]\n- E2\n    - title: Final release date established\n    - date: 2025-08-10\n    - why it matters causally: Proximate trigger for the actual release.\n    - source article IDs: [art_culture_20250810_003_9a8d8418]\n\n## Evidence Mapping Table\n| Claim/Event | Article IDs | Date Support | Confidence (0-1) | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Reshoots announced | [art_culture_20240315_002_44849d65] | 2024-03-15 | 1.0 | Initial delay trigger |\n| Release date set to Sept 15 | [art_culture_20250810_003_9a8d8418] | 2025-08-10 | 1.0 | Final date confirmation |\n\n## Uncertainties And Alternative Paths\nThere was minor uncertainty regarding whether the reshoots would satisfy the subject and the studio, which could have led to further delays into 2026 or outright cancellation.\n",
