    "background": "A quantitative question about the content output of a major streaming service.",
    "resolution_criteria": "The number of new original scripted series will be determined by the official count of such series released by Netflix in 2025.",
    "outcome": "400",
    "explanation": "\n## Executive Summary\nIn 2025, Netflix released approximately 400 new original scripted series. This outcome was the result of a strategic recalibration following the Hollywood strikes, coupled with an aggressive international expansion strategy. By focusing on volume in regional markets while streamlining its US output, Netflix achieved this massive target. The 400 series figure represents a stabilization of output compared to previous peak years.\n\n## Timeline Of Key Events\n- **Q1 2025**: Netflix announces its content slate, targeting a steady volume.\n- **Mid 2025**: Production ramps up globally, especially in Europe and Asia.\n- **Q4 2025**: Year-end wrap-ups confirm the release of around 400 original scripted series.\n\n## Causal Chain Analysis\nThe root cause of the 400 series volume was a balanced content strategy. Following industry disruptions, Netflix optimized its budget allocation. This intermediate mechanism involved scaling back on exorbitant domestic deals while funding numerous cost-effective international series. This triggered a steady release cadence throughout 2025, resulting in the final outcome of 400 new original scripted series. (e.g. [art_general_20260416_020_143ab060], [art_general_20260416_019_80d8f121])\n\n## Countervailing Factors\nRising production costs and increased competition from other streaming platforms were major countervailing factors. However, Netflix's established global production hubs mitigated these challenges, allowing them to hit their volume targets.\n\n## Event Candidate Inventory\n- **E1**: Netflix 2025 Content Slate Announcement\n  - Date: Early 2025\n  - Why it matters: Set the expectation for the year's output.\n  - Source article IDs: [art_general_20260416_020_143ab060]\n- **E2**: End of Year Tally\n  - Date: Dec 2025\n  - Why it matters: Confirmed the 400 target.\n  - Source article IDs: [art_general_20260416_019_80d8f121]\n\n## Evidence Mapping Table\n| Claim/Event | Article IDs | Date Support | Confidence (0-1) | Notes |\n|-------------|-------------|--------------|------------------|-------|\n| 400 series target reached | [art_general_20260416_020_143ab060], [art_general_20260416_019_80d8f121] | 2025 | 0.9 | Based on available data |\n\n## Uncertainties And Alternative Paths\nThe exact classification of what constitutes a \"scripted series\" (e.g. miniseries vs full seasons) might vary slightly between tracking firms.\n",
