        "description": "The Los Angeles Dodgers set an MLB spending record with a final payroll reaching over $515 million.",
        "impact": "**Affects:** Option 1: Los Angeles Dodgers  \n\n**Direction:** Towards outcome    \n\n**Reasoning:**\nMassive payroll enabled roster building",
